    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/bd3d2665a3365e4d8041858b08eb513e.poster.avif?t=1755267337\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/bd3d2665a3365e4d8041858b08eb513e.webm?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/bd3d2665a3365e4d8041858b08eb513e.mp4?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Defend your armored rig from endless waves of ruthless raiders in the intense roguelike survival driller, Dead Oil. Between brutal attacks, drill deep into the scorched earth of a post-apocalyptic wasteland to extract oil and salvage valuable resources. Choose your upgrades carefully to reinforce your rig, improve your drilling capabilities, and ensure your survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/7e2123544346d84bd7fc37b5cb6d7131.avif?t=1755267337\" width=1040 height=236 /></span>Dig deep beneath your rig to find hidden caches of oil and rare metals essential for upgrading your defenses. Keep your eyes on the clock, you must return and prepare for the next fierce attack. How much oil can you find before danger arrives?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/4b879ce0f86476c46b8b784057242e93.poster.avif?t=1755267337\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/4b879ce0f86476c46b8b784057242e93.webm?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/4b879ce0f86476c46b8b784057242e93.mp4?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/c91e488b5dab3b26fe077b108d01be3e.avif?t=1755267337\" width=1040 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your rig\u2019s powerful defenses and fight off raiders that attack from every direction. From swift melee attackers to armored vehicles and artillery strikes, prioritize your targets or watch your rig crumble to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/1ad38e13214c646af5d7159f68ba74ab.poster.avif?t=1755267337\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/1ad38e13214c646af5d7159f68ba74ab.webm?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/1ad38e13214c646af5d7159f68ba74ab.mp4?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/74d4a90d11e9be49dd2f6df16e523d5f.avif?t=1755267337\" width=1040 height=236 /></span>Turn scavenged scrap and oil into formidable upgrades: enhance your weapons, reinforce armor plating, accelerate your drilling speed, and upgrade your radar to detect valuable resources faster. Every choice you make increases your chances of surviving Dead Oil.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/a432de1515ade92edd91a128e0463fae.poster.avif?t=1755267337\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/a432de1515ade92edd91a128e0463fae.webm?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/a432de1515ade92edd91a128e0463fae.mp4?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/bd3d2665a3365e4d8041858b08eb513e.poster.avif?t=1755267337\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/bd3d2665a3365e4d8041858b08eb513e.webm?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/bd3d2665a3365e4d8041858b08eb513e.mp4?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Defend your armored rig from endless waves of ruthless raiders in the intense roguelike survival driller, Dead Oil. Between brutal attacks, drill deep into the scorched earth of a post-apocalyptic wasteland to extract oil and salvage valuable resources. Choose your upgrades carefully to reinforce your rig, improve your drilling capabilities, and ensure your survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/7e2123544346d84bd7fc37b5cb6d7131.avif?t=1755267337\" width=1040 height=236 /></span>Dig deep beneath your rig to find hidden caches of oil and rare metals essential for upgrading your defenses. Keep your eyes on the clock, you must return and prepare for the next fierce attack. How much oil can you find before danger arrives?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/4b879ce0f86476c46b8b784057242e93.poster.avif?t=1755267337\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/4b879ce0f86476c46b8b784057242e93.webm?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/4b879ce0f86476c46b8b784057242e93.mp4?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/c91e488b5dab3b26fe077b108d01be3e.avif?t=1755267337\" width=1040 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your rig\u2019s powerful defenses and fight off raiders that attack from every direction. From swift melee attackers to armored vehicles and artillery strikes, prioritize your targets or watch your rig crumble to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/1ad38e13214c646af5d7159f68ba74ab.poster.avif?t=1755267337\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/1ad38e13214c646af5d7159f68ba74ab.webm?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/1ad38e13214c646af5d7159f68ba74ab.mp4?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/74d4a90d11e9be49dd2f6df16e523d5f.avif?t=1755267337\" width=1040 height=236 /></span>Turn scavenged scrap and oil into formidable upgrades: enhance your weapons, reinforce armor plating, accelerate your drilling speed, and upgrade your radar to detect valuable resources faster. Every choice you make increases your chances of surviving Dead Oil.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/a432de1515ade92edd91a128e0463fae.poster.avif?t=1755267337\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/a432de1515ade92edd91a128e0463fae.webm?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669370/extras/a432de1515ade92edd91a128e0463fae.mp4?t=1755267337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
